# This repo tracks the emulator/build scaffold and our decisions (CLAUDE.md,
# AGENTS.md, Dockerfiles, scripts, the android-dev skill). It must NOT track any
# large or machine-specific container state — that all lives elsewhere:
#   - the SDK/AVD/system images live on /data/storage/android (outside this dir)
#   - each app's Gradle cache lives in <project>/.gradle-cache (outside this dir)
# The patterns below are belt-and-suspenders in case any of that ever lands here.

# Per-project Gradle caches / build output, if ever created in-tree
.gradle-cache/
.gradle/
build/
**/build/outputs/

# Android SDK / AVD / system images, if ever bootstrapped in-tree
sdk/
avd/
*.qcow2
*.img
*.zip

# Built artifacts
*.apk
*.aab

# Editor / OS noise
*.log
*.tmp
.DS_Store
